uplink-announcementpad-name = Handheld Announcement Pad
uplink-announcementpad-desc = Hacks into both the Platform's and the Underwater base's announcement systems. Removal of your ID before use is suggested.

uplink-beachball-name = Beachball Grenade
uplink-beachball-desc = A beachball that's been super-inflated. If popped, it will push everything around it. Single use only.

uplink-hostage-bag-name = Hostage Bag
uplink-hostage-bag-desc = A backpack containing three zipties, a muzzle, and a blindfold. It will help out with any hostage or abduction situations.

uplink-lubejug-name = Jug of Space Lube
uplink-lubejug-desc = A jug of space lube to dump in security, or any important area. It's enough to make a grown clown cry.

uplink-NT-borgingkit-name = Undetermined Borging Kit
uplink-NT-borgingkit-desc = A toolbox containing everything an Agent needs to modify up to two borgs. Tools not included in this toolbox.

uplink-omega-soap-name = Omega Soap (Residue free)
uplink-omega-soap-desc = O-O-O-Omega Soap! They have no idea what's in store for them! It also removes all traces of residue.
